OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright start to the evening but
OL,7,Fthicker cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fwill spread eastwards. A cloudy night
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of rain continuing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FA cloudy day with occasional
OL,12,Frain. Best of any dry and bright
OL,13,Fspells most likely towards the evening.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,16,FFurther rain spreading east on Monday
OL,17,Fthen bright spells and scattered
OL,18,Fshowers on Tuesday. Showers turning
OL,19,Fheavy and thundery on Wednesday.
